    <string name="lan_send_link">Send a link for Telegram</string>
    <string name="lan_help">To route a computer or another phone on the same Wi-Fi (or on your hotspot) through Tor, open the t.me/socks link on it or set the proxy manually. The proxy opens only on Wi-Fi or hotspot and only for local addresses, but it has no password — use it only on your own network.</string>
